   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Handicap Institute has gathered materials and tools aimed at children with special educational needs in an exhibition called Childrens Train.The Ministries of Education in the three Baltic countries has asked for a visit by the Childrens Train. The project consists of the preparations for, transportation and arrangement of the Childrens Train one week respectively in Estonia, Latvia and Lith</narrative>
